SRHHYDRO 30
Case "block_in_channel_hydrograph"
Description "2D channel with a block; inflow pulse after a 360 s spin-up"
RunType FLOW
ModelTemp OFF
UnsteadyOutput UNSTEADY
SimTime 0.0 0.5 0.1666666667
TurbulenceModel PARABOLIC
ParabolicTurbulence 0.7
InitCondOption AUTO
Grid "block_in_channel.srhgeom"
HydroMat "block_in_channel.srhmat"
OutputFormat XMDFC SI
OutputOption 1
OutputInterval 0.0027777778
ManningsN 0 0.03
ManningsN 1 0.03
BC 1 INLET-Q
BC 2 EXIT-H
BC 3 WALL
BC 4 WALL
BC 5 WALL
IQParams 1 inflow_hydrograph.xys SI CONVEYANCE
EWSParams 2 0.4 SI C
